{"id":"msg_m_ex_marciana_02","cat":"messenger","group":{"id":"room_marciana","label":"Marciana · Nikke"},"label":"2. Heya, Commander!","stage":null,"prev":"msg_m_ex_marciana_01","next":"msg_m_ex_marciana_03","speakers":{"marciana":"Marciana"},"icons":{"marciana":"si_c321_00_s"},"lines":[{"id":"m_ex_marciana_02_1","type":"Speech","speaker":"marciana","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_marciana_02_1","text":"Heya, Commander!","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_marciana_02_2","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_marciana_02_2","text":"... What's up?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_marciana_02_3","type":"Speech","speaker":"marciana","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_marciana_02_3","text":"Nuthin.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_marciana_02_4","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_marciana_02_4","text":"Is everything okay over there?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_marciana_02_5","type":"Speech","speaker":"marciana","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_marciana_02_5","text":"Yeppers.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_marciana_02_6","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_marciana_02_6","text":"This is Marciana, right?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_marciana_02_7","type":"Speech","speaker":"marciana","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_marciana_02_7","text":"Yeah, sure!","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_marciana_02_8","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_marciana_02_8","text":"...","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_marciana_02_9","type":"Speech","speaker":"marciana","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_marciana_02_9","text":"Is something wrong, Commander?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_marciana_02_10","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_marciana_02_10","text":"There you are, Marciana.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_marciana_02_11","type":"Speech","speaker":"marciana","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_marciana_02_11","text":"...?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_marciana_02_12","type":"Speech","speaker":"marciana","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_marciana_02_12","text":"It was me the entire time.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_marciana_02_13","type":"Speech","speaker":"marciana","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_marciana_02_13","text":"Is 'Heya' not a proper greeting?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_marciana_02_14","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_marciana_02_14","text":"It's not that, it's just...","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_marciana_02_15","type":"Speech","speaker":"marciana","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_marciana_02_15","text":"Okay, good.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_marciana_02_16","type":"Speech","speaker":"marciana","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_marciana_02_16","text":"The last time I spoke to you on Bla,","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_marciana_02_17","type":"Speech","speaker":"marciana","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_marciana_02_17","text":"you used that expression, and it was unfamiliar to me.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_marciana_02_18","type":"Speech","speaker":"marciana","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_marciana_02_18","text":"So, I had Ein teach me some new slangs today.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_marciana_02_19","type":"Speech","speaker":"marciana","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_marciana_02_19","text":"Of which \"Heya\" was one.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_marciana_02_20","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_marciana_02_20","text":"\"Heya\" is just short for \"hey you\".","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_marciana_02_21","type":"Speech","speaker":"marciana","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_marciana_02_21","text":"... Huh?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_marciana_02_22","type":"Monologue","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_marciana_02_22","text":"There is no reply from Marciana for a while. She might be searching for the proper linguistic term to utilize.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_marciana_02_23","type":"Speech","speaker":"marciana","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_marciana_02_23","text":"Sorry.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_marciana_02_24","type":"Speech","speaker":"marciana","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_marciana_02_24","text":"I've made a mistake.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_marciana_02_25","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_marciana_02_25","text":"Nah, it's fine. I use that kind of slang all the time.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_marciana_02_26","type":"Speech","speaker":"marciana","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_marciana_02_26","text":"...","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_marciana_02_27","type":"Speech","speaker":"marciana","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_marciana_02_27","text":"Sure, but all I did was making you confused.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_marciana_02_28","type":"Choice","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_marciana_02_28","text":"Only because you sounded totally different from your usual self.","jump":"m_ex_marciana_02_30"},{"id":"m_ex_marciana_02_29","type":"Choice","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_marciana_02_29","text":"I was a bit caught off guard, but it wasn't what I'd call unpleasant.","jump":"m_ex_marciana_02_32"},{"id":"m_ex_marciana_02_30","type":"Speech","speaker":"marciana","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_marciana_02_30","text":"...","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_marciana_02_31","type":"Speech","speaker":"marciana","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_marciana_02_31","text":"So you thought I was someone else...","jump":"m_ex_marciana_02_34"},{"id":"m_ex_marciana_02_32","type":"Speech","speaker":"marciana","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_marciana_02_32","text":"Hmm?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_marciana_02_33","type":"Speech","speaker":"marciana","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_marciana_02_33","text":"...","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_marciana_02_34","type":"Monologue","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_marciana_02_34","text":"Again, there is no reply from Marciana for a while.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_marciana_02_35","type":"Speech","speaker":"marciana","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_marciana_02_35","text":"Going forward, I'll be more judicious about what I learn from Ein.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_marciana_02_36","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_marciana_02_36","text":"It's okay, honestly. It felt more casual with you using slang.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_marciana_02_37","type":"Speech","speaker":"marciana","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_marciana_02_37","text":"Really?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_marciana_02_38","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_marciana_02_38","text":"Totally.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_marciana_02_39","type":"Speech","speaker":"marciana","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_marciana_02_39","text":"Well...","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_marciana_02_40","type":"Speech","speaker":"marciana","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_marciana_02_40","text":"I'm glad to hear that.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_marciana_02_41","type":"Speech","speaker":"marciana","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_marciana_02_41","text":"Still, I think I'll refrain from using it too much.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_marciana_02_42","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_marciana_02_42","text":"Too bad...","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_marciana_02_43","type":"Speech","speaker":"marciana","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_marciana_02_43","text":"Zwei says she has a question she wants to ask me.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_marciana_02_44","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_marciana_02_44","text":"Okay, since we're signing off for the day, you should say \"deuces\".","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_marciana_02_45","type":"Speech","speaker":"marciana","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_marciana_02_45","text":"...","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_marciana_02_46","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_marciana_02_46","text":"Come on, say it.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_marciana_02_47","type":"Speech","speaker":"marciana","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_marciana_02_47","text":"...","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_marciana_02_48","type":"Speech","speaker":"marciana","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_marciana_02_48","text":"... I'll be in touch, Commander.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_marciana_02_49","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_marciana_02_49","text":"Deuces!","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_marciana_02_50","type":"Speech","speaker":"marciana","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_marciana_02_50","text":"...","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_marciana_02_51","type":"Speech","speaker":"marciana","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_marciana_02_51","text":"... Deuces.","jump":null}],"chat":true}